// Title: Suspicious Reconnaissance Activity Using Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// ID: c8a180d6-47a3-4345-a609-53f9c3d834fc
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-10
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.001
// Description: Detects suspicious reconnaissance command line activity on Windows systems using the PowerShell Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_Get-LocalGroupMember *") and ((process.command_line like "*_domain admins*" or process.command_line like "*_ administrator*" or process.command_line like "*_ administrateur*" or process.command_line like "*_enterprise admins*" or process.command_line like "*_Exchange Trusted Subsystem*" or process.command_line like "*_Remote Desktop Users*" or process.command_line like "*_Utilisateurs du Bureau à distance*" or process.command_line like "*_Usuarios de escritorio remoto*")))
